Package: araponga
Title: Estimate 3D Orientations from 2D Landmarks
Version: 1.1.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("João C T", "Menezes", , "jocateme@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4156-2934"))
Description: Estimates possible 3D orientations of directed objects from the 2D image coordinates of two landmarks and any additional information about the imaging geometry or object. Because a 2D image generally does not uniquely determine a 3D orientation, the package returns sets of compatible pitch, yaw, and view-elevation angles rather than a single unconstrained estimate.
License: GPL (>= 3)
